nce for their great questions  any of these questions that we did not  have time for today  will be addressed by our speakers via  the contact information you provided at  the time of registration  thank you again megan and jenny do you  have any final comments for our audience  before we go today  well we really appreciate everybody  joining us today  and you know like michelle said we'll be  reaching out so we look forward to  speaking with you guys  i do just want to say though that we do  have for those who are looking to get  started on their work quickly  reach out to us we have a limited  quantity  of select free dryers available for  immediate shipping so  we are ready to help you get started and  i think that's it for me jenny did you  have anything else  nope that's all i have but we will be  reaching out to everyone shortly  thank you again megan and jenny for your  time today and your research  i'd like to thank lavrov and our sponsor  lab conco for underwriting today's  educational webcast  until next time goodbye  you
 

